			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1770226990435,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "-- Example 3 — Chat Application (Hard)\n\n-- Requirements:\n-- Total users = 10,000,000 (10^7)\n-- DAU = 20% = 2,000,000 (2 × 10^6)\n-- Messages per user per day = 50\n-- Message size = 1 KB (10^3 bytes)\n-- Retention = 2 years\n-- Peak factor = 8x\n\n-- Requests:\nMessages_per_day = 2 * 10^6 * 50 = 1 * 10^8\nAverage_RPS = 1 * 10^8 / 86400 ≈ 1157 RPS\nPeak_RPS = 1157 * 8 ≈ 9300 RPS\n\n-- Storage:\nDaily_storage_bytes = 1 * 10^8 * 10^3 = 1 * 10^11 bytes = 100 GB/day\nYearly_storage_TB = 100 * 365 / 1024 ≈ 36.5 TB/year\nStorage_2yr_with_replication_TB = 36.5 * 2 * 3 ≈ 219 TB\n\n-- Bandwidth:\nDaily_bandwidth_GB = 100\nAverage_bandwidth_MBps = 100 * 1024 / 86400 ≈ 1.2 MB/sec\nPeak_bandwidth_MBps = ~10+\n\n-- Memory:\nHot_data_3days_GB = 100 * 3 = 300 GB\nCache_subset_10percent_GB = 30\n",
			"rawText": "-- Example 3 — Chat Application (Hard)\n\n-- Requirements:\n-- Total users = 10,000,000 (10^7)\n-- DAU = 20% = 2,000,000 (2 × 10^6)\n-- Messages per user per day = 50\n-- Message size = 1 KB (10^3 bytes)\n-- Retention = 2 years\n-- Peak factor = 8x\n\n-- Requests:\nMessages_per_day = 2 * 10^6 * 50 = 1 * 10^8\nAverage_RPS = 1 * 10^8 / 86400 ≈ 1157 RPS\nPeak_RPS = 1157 * 8 ≈ 9300 RPS\n\n-- Storage:\nDaily_storage_bytes = 1 * 10^8 * 10^3 = 1 * 10^11 bytes = 100 GB/day\nYearly_storage_TB = 100 * 365 / 1024 ≈ 36.5 TB/year\nStorage_2yr_with_replication_TB = 36.5 * 2 * 3 ≈ 219 TB\n\n-- Bandwidth:\nDaily_bandwidth_GB = 100\nAverage_bandwidth_MBps = 100 * 1024 / 86400 ≈ 1.2 MB/sec\nPeak_bandwidth_MBps = ~10+\n\n-- Memory:\nHot_data_3days_GB = 100 * 3 = 300 GB\nCache_subset_10percent_GB = 30\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "IR88pmEOSUT4M_iMKbdEp",
			"originalText": "-- Example 3 — Chat Application (Hard)\n\n-- Requirements:\n-- Total users = 10,000,000 (10^7)\n-- DAU = 20% = 2,000,000 (2 × 10^6)\n-- Messages per user per day = 50\n-- Message size = 1 KB (10^3 bytes)\n-- Retention = 2 years\n-- Peak factor = 8x\n\n-- Requests:\nMessages_per_day = 2 * 10^6 * 50 = 1 * 10^8\nAverage_RPS = 1 * 10^8 / 86400 ≈ 1157 RPS\nPeak_RPS = 1157 * 8 ≈ 9300 RPS\n\n-- Storage:\nDaily_storage_bytes = 1 * 10^8 * 10^3 = 1 * 10^11 bytes = 100 GB/day\nYearly_storage_TB = 100 * 365 / 1024 ≈ 36.5 TB/year\nStorage_2yr_with_replication_TB = 36.5 * 2 * 3 ≈ 219 TB\n\n-- Bandwidth:\nDaily_bandwidth_GB = 100\nAverage_bandwidth_MBps = 100 * 1024 / 86400 ≈ 1.2 MB/sec\nPeak_bandwidth_MBps = ~10+\n\n-- Memory:\nHot_data_3days_GB = 100 * 3 = 300 GB\nCache_subset_10percent_GB = 30\n",
			"autoResize": true,
